scriptdefs
= VerdanturfTown_WandasHouse_EventScript_Wanda
lock
faceplayer
goto_if_set FLAG_DEFEATED_LAVARIDGE_GYM VerdanturfTown_WandasHouse_EventScript_WandaDontWorry
goto_if_set FLAG_DEFEATED_WALLY_MAUVILLE VerdanturfTown_WandasHouse_EventScript_MeetWanda
msgbox	WANDA: Don't worry about WALLY. He'll be just fine.I know my little cousin, and he has POKéMON with him, too.
release
end
= VerdanturfTown_WandasHouse_EventScript_MeetWanda
msgbox	WANDA: You are? Oh, right, I get it!You're the PLAYER who WALLY was telling me about.I'm WALLY's cousin. Glad to meet you!I think WALLY's become a lot more lively and healthy since he came here.
release
end
= VerdanturfTown_WandasHouse_EventScript_WandaDontWorry
msgbox	WANDA: Don't worry about WALLY. He'll be just fine.I know my little cousin, and he has POKéMON with him, too.
release
end
= VerdanturfTown_WandasHouse_EventScript_WallysAunt
lock
faceplayer
goto_if_set FLAG_DEFEATED_WALLY_VICTORY_ROAD VerdanturfTown_WandasHouse_EventScript_WallysAuntEverGrande
goto_if_set FLAG_DEFEATED_LAVARIDGE_GYM VerdanturfTown_WandasHouse_EventScript_WallysAuntAnythingHappened
goto_if_set FLAG_RUSTURF_TUNNEL_OPENED VerdanturfTown_WandasHouse_EventScript_WallysAuntTunnelOpen
msgbox	My daughter's boyfriend is a very driven and passionate sort of person.He's been digging a tunnel nonstop just so he can see my daughter.My daughter's a little concerned, so she goes out to the tunnel a lot.
release
end
= VerdanturfTown_WandasHouse_EventScript_WallysAuntTunnelOpen
msgbox	It's amazing. My daughter's boyfriend was digging the tunnel by hand!It's so incredible!
release
end
= VerdanturfTown_WandasHouse_EventScript_WallysAuntAnythingHappened
msgbox	If anything were to happen to WALLY, I would never be able to look his parents in PETALBURG in the eye…
release
end
= VerdanturfTown_WandasHouse_EventScript_WallysAuntEverGrande
msgbox	WALLY was in EVER GRANDE?His parents in PETALBURG would be astonished to hear that!
release
end
= VerdanturfTown_WandasHouse_EventScript_WallysUncle
lock
faceplayer
goto_if_set FLAG_DEFEATED_WALLY_VICTORY_ROAD VerdanturfTown_WandasHouse_EventScript_WallysUncleEverGrande
goto_if_set FLAG_DEFEATED_LAVARIDGE_GYM VerdanturfTown_WandasHouse_EventScript_WallysUncleSlippedOff
msgbox	UNCLE: Oh! PLAYER! WALLY's next door.But, boy, there's something I have to tell you.This natural environment is doing wonders for WALLY's health.Maybe it's not just the environment. It could be POKéMON that are giving the boy hope.
release
end
= VerdanturfTown_WandasHouse_EventScript_WallysUncleSlippedOff
msgbox	WALLY's gone away… He slipped off on his own…
release
end
= VerdanturfTown_WandasHouse_EventScript_WallysUncleEverGrande
msgbox	UNCLE: Is that right? WALLY's gone away that far all by himself…Well, I have to give him credit--he is my little brother's son.
release
end
= VerdanturfTown_WandasHouse_EventScript_WandasBoyfriend
msgbox	Thanks to you, I can see my girlfriend every day. Happy? You bet I am!
end
= VerdanturfTown_WandasHouse_EventScript_Wally
lock
faceplayer
goto_if_set FLAG_WALLY_SPEECH VerdanturfTown_WandasHouse_EventScript_WallyShortSpeech
msgbox	WALLY: I lost to you, PLAYER, but I'm not feeling down anymore.Because I have a new purpose in life. Together with my RALTS, I'm going to challenge POKéMON GYMS and become a great TRAINER.Please watch me, PLAYER. I'm going to be stronger than you.When I do, I'm going to challenge you to another battle.
setflag FLAG_WALLY_SPEECH
release
end
= VerdanturfTown_WandasHouse_EventScript_WallyShortSpeech
msgbox	WALLY: Please watch me, PLAYER. I'm going to get stronger than you.When I do, I'm going to challenge you to another battle.
release
end
